# Desktop UI (plans 18–21, standing)

These are **product constraints for all future renderer work**, not only the original review PRs.
The mechanical “one task per turn / never change behaviour” contract in
`.cursor/plans/UI-REVIEW-EXECUTION.md` applied only while executing plans 18–21.

## 18 — Focus and control state

- Prefer shadcn `@/components/ui/*` so focus rings come for free.
- Bespoke controls (tabs, rails, canvas chrome, raw `<button>`) must include `focusRing` from `@/lib/focusRing.js`.
- Hover-only chrome (`opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100`) also needs `focus-visible:opacity-100` or `focus-within:opacity-100`.
- Toggle/rail buttons: `aria-pressed` / `aria-current` as appropriate.
- Live status belongs in `aria-live` regions (status bar pattern), not only toast text.
- Dialogs need a title and description (visible or `sr-only`).

## 19 — Form labelling

- Every visible field label uses `htmlFor` pointing at the control `id`.
- IDs: kebab-case, surface prefix (`inspector-http-url`, `request-url`, `sidebar-flows-search`). Row ids, never array indexes.

## 20 — Design system

- Type: `text-xs` / `text-2xs` / `text-3xs` — no new `text-[9px]` / `text-[10px]` / `text-[11px]`.
- Color: semantic tokens (`background`, `foreground`, `muted-foreground`, `border`, `warning`, `destructive`). No new `gray-*` / `blue-*` on app chrome.
- Reuse `EmptyState`, `FieldHint`, `CodeChip`, `SectionHeading`, `SettingsPageLayout` instead of one-off copy blocks.
- Unsaved: the small primary/warning dot pattern, not a new glyph.
- New actions: shadcn `Button` / `Alert`, not raw styled `<button>`/`<div>`.

## 21 — Render perf

- One `useQuesterStore` per primitive. Do not subscribe to `selectActiveFlowRun` as an object.
- Good: `useQuesterStore((s) => selectActiveFlowRun(s).isRunning)`
- `useShallow` only for genuine collections.
- Do not add `React.memo` on canvas nodes here — that is plan 17.

## Smoke-test strings

Keep unless the change **is** that UI copy:

- `aria-label="Flows"` / `aria-label="Preferences"` on the activity bar
- Canvas `Environment` and Run button name `Run`
- `{n} nodes · {e} edges` (middle dot, un-pluralised `edges`)
- Welcome `<h1>` `Quester Studio`
- Preferences category names `Appearance` / `Network`; label `Theme`
